client_msg_id":"6b4ebb73-28b5-4ded-a768-e73a14786735","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"「再生直後にデータ突っ込んでも再生されなかったりノイズになったりする」っていうのは実はあんま経験したことないですね（なんでだろ）","ts":"1620151035.331800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RdYMS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77cc4b84-2ea8-45ee-ae1f-c1a98e575ae7","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"でもまてよ、これ質問に答えてないな","ts":"1620151008.331000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ro"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c74aa87-f63b-4c91-bbef-dec2a95a7e26","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"この chunk はある程度小さすぎると書き込みが間に合わず音がとぎれとぎれになりますが、大きすぎるとレイテンシ（書き込んでから再生するまでの時間）が長くなるので、つらいです","ts":"1620150963.330700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sYN0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8ccddb3-52e8-4dfe-9d08-6ee775fbca72","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"イメージ的にはレコード盤の針の直前にデータを載せていく感じです（直後に再生されるデータを、chunkごとに書きこむ）","ts":"1620150909.329500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rFS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"322cf62b-e586-4aa2-a621-8460aaab8288","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"音を再生するときはプリミティブにはメモリ上のある領域にデータを書き込むんですが","ts":"1620150853.328500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QbZ3U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93a1e459-5ee4-4836-b269-13b18d8208e4","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"一回の音ゲー開発者として語ると、まあ大体そんな感じだと思います","ts":"1620150827.327800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n10PT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e4e0555-3e34-44d8-a535-65a4c4cc3350","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u0026gt; 再生直後にデータ突っ込んでも再生されなかったりノイズになったり\n要はここが気になってて、バッファに乗せるのが時間かかることは仕様で、時間的に余裕もってバッファに乗せようねってことなのか？？っていう","ts":"1620150689.327300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YqBmZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a7d8e36-6c42-47ad-a7f1-991d7ee29475","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"すごく適当なことを言ってみるんですが、効果音とかって\nあらかじめ音をバッファにある程度載せておいて、後から再生開始するみたいにして、\nそれでもなおうまく再生されないみたいな感じなんですかね？","ts":"1620150549.326400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Awc/3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb6be93e-5685-48c0-bb8f-481df1e4d8b3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"1/60[s] じゃたらんかもしれないな、つらい","ts":"1620148949.325600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"URa8e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"906a5f93-3c9e-421d-b780-d3496b1146f6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"次は iOS ですね…","ts":"1620148620.325300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CMxg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"883a2335-437a-4b3b-a1ba-b1dac7b32987","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Oboe 順調です","ts":"1620148617.325100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p9Zvr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1127e1d-2446-4580-bdc3-ab9510be781f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ふう…","ts":"1620148610.324900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"opHYe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da9d6161-012d-461c-91bc-eb6cb2a49f9f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"結局 1/60[s] の空白 + 予めある程度のデータは突っ込んでおく、でノイズは消えたっぽい","ts":"1620148608.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"clW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d5adc25-c1f0-4ec3-9eee-b370daa3ddff","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"視覚は確実に処理させてるんですかね…よくわか